  "description": "Emulates an Oculus Touch controller: Resonite's Touch mode, the one with a dash button. Black button (Start/Select): dash. MENU: context menu. Left pink button: SteamVR dashboard. Grab: a quick tap of the grip holds until the next press, a longer press grabs while held. Precision grab is implemented in Resonite from the skeleton. Flux Actions (MoreFluxActions mod), left/right: black button held 1/2, C 3/4, D 5/6, E 7/8, two-finger point 36/37, pinky pinch 38/39, index point 40/41.",
